# What a run produces, and what it is evidence of, are not the same thing.
# Out: the graphs and the candidates, 180 MB each, rebuilt in one command from the truth.
# In: the sealed journal, the seed and the logs — without them no claim on this bench is checkable,
# and START-HERE.md and ANOMALY-label-repair.md both send a reader to them.
